      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGICAL ANG (1) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a one length win at this track in a handy 22.06. Well suited by the inside box and likes the trip. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. One of the key runners again. DRINK TO THAT (5) could not have been more impressive last start in his quick 22.91 win at The Gardens in a Grade 5 over 400m. In form and must include in calculations. BIGBAD EDEN (2) turned in a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 388m behind MAGICAL ANG (22.91) in a Grade 5. Placed at her previous run. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. FANTASY ETHICS (7) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
